  _data:
    _json: '{"graph":{"variables":{"Kind":"Flow","collection":{"$content":[],"$version":"A"},"$version":"A"},"controlInputDefinitions":[],"controlOutputDefinitions":[],"valueInputDefinitions":[],"valueOutputDefinitions":[],"title":"Town - explore the town","summary":"The town view: on the ''Town'' event (the port menu''s first choice) the camera rises off the ship into the 2D map over the town, with its market docked beside it. When the player goes back to the ship, the port''s menu opens again.","pan":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"zoom":1.0,"elements":[{"argumentCount":0,"coroutine":true,"defaultValues":{"target":null,"name":{"$content":"Town","$type":"System.String"}},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"c887d3cc-d2e8-4bf4-840e-c8bf0b8609b1","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.CustomEvent","$id":"9"},{"specifyFallback":false,"kind":"Object","defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"Docked port","$type":"System.String"},"object":null},"position":{"x":0.0,"y":200.0},"guid":"aa11e07c-8049-46f8-ab7a-8747626afc0e","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GetVariable","$id":"11"},{"defaultValues":{"port":null},"position":{"x":300.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"7053af24-7a7c-46a9-a6a7-8ed54017a831","$version":"A","$type":"Kapman.Graphs.TownExplore","$id":"13"},{"argumentCount":0,"defaultValues":{"name":{"$content":"Port menu","$type":"System.String"},"target":null},"position":{"x":600.0,"y":0.0},"guid":"e2fefa64-cd0a-4627-a3d9-84ff4d9aa53f","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.TriggerCustomEvent","$id":"15"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"9"},"sourceKey":"trigger","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"13"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"d399b75e-3976-43ac-8532-8d961953c342","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"13"},"sourceKey":"exit","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"15"},"destinationKey":"enter","guid":"8557b7cd-ab89-4dbd-907a-8f2d44a3bf5b","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ControlConnection"},{"sourceUnit":{"$ref":"11"},"sourceKey":"value","destinationUnit":{"$ref":"13"},"destinationKey":"port","guid":"4c208d56-cfb0-4b86-b136-47d01cc84949","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.ValueConnection"},{"position":{"xMin":-40.0,"yMin":-60.0,"xMax":1260.0,"yMax":320.0},"label":"1. Up into the town''s map","comment":"Town: Explore plays the rise (camera up, the map fading in, settling on the town), opens the market beside the map, and waits till the player is back down at the ship (Back to the ship, or Esc).","color":{"r":0.62,"g":0.45,"b":0.22,"a":1.0},"guid":"b3554ea5-b337-4ee9-9509-bd2a72e512dc","$version":"A","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.GraphGroup"},{"position":{"xMin":860.0,"yMin":0.0,"xMax":1240.0,"yMax":260.0},"title":"The map and the market","body":"The map: Code/Game/Map (MapView: the rise, panning and zoom, ports, the ship; MapRenderer: drawing the map from the baked land; Exploration: the fog of war). [M] opens it at sea.\nThe market: Code/Game/UI/MarketPanel.cs, docked on the right. Pick a good: the map marks where it''s made and wanted, and what it fetched where you''ve seen it.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"a3427bad-68b4-416f-bc53-dc9bd128044a","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"}],"$version":"A"}}'
    _objectReferences: []
